{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25510402768600696", "organization": {"id": "429881964074408", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "25510402768600696"}]}, "id": "1466326061123068"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "7223009247722036"}]}, "id": "762032065800944"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "6069863423110286"}]}, "id": "925949978648479"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "3554141864633866"}]}, "id": "1330197087362854"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "2094875630626287"}]}, "id": "433377454090521"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "25510402768600696", "release_date": 1780672740, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "29490612483913018"}, "id": "1180826333517691"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1795617329, "id": "29596982673275998", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v7", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 6, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "29597322396575359"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "25510402768600696"}, "id": "29597322396575359", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "25510402768600696", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1998985487616368"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2594749390936334", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Immersive DJ", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Nahtlose Mixe \u2013 direkt in deinem Zimmer, in der K\u00fcche oder wo immer du willst!**\n\nDiese Mixed-Reality-DJ-App vereint die Werkzeuge eines einfach zu bedienenden DJ-Setups mit der Leichtigkeit und dem Spa\u00df von MR.\n\n# Das bietet dir die App:\n\n* **Nahtlose Mixing-Tools**\n\n Nutze **Sync**, **Cue** und sanfte Crossfades f\u00fcr m\u00fchelose \u00dcberg\u00e4nge.\n\n* **Scratchen wie in echt**\n\n Reaktionsschnelle virtuelle Decks lassen dich scratchen, um Tracks anzugleichen, und wie ein Instrument spielen.\n\n* **Waveforms auf einen Blick**\n\n\u00dcbersichts- und scrollende Waveforms mit **frequenzbasierter Farbdarstellung** zeigen dir jeden Drop, jeden Breakdown und jeden Beat. Tippe auf eine Waveform, um zu dieser Stelle im Track zu springen \u2013 immer im Takt!\n\n* **SoundCloud + integrierte Bibliothek**\n\nSuche und lade Tracks schnell von **SoundCloud** oder st\u00f6bere in unserer kuratierten Bibliothek und leg sofort los.\n\n* **EQ-Sektion \u2013 nichts geht \u00fcber einen Filter-Sweep!**\n\nForme deinen Sound mit vertrauten DJ-Reglern: **Color**, **Low**, **Mid** und **High**.\n\n* **Nat\u00fcrliches Handtracking**\n\nKeine Controller n\u00f6tig. Bediene Decks, Regler und Fader mit deinen H\u00e4nden \u2013 ein Erlebnis, das sich wirklich physisch anf\u00fchlt.\n\nOb Performance per Casting, \u00dcben oder einfach Spa\u00df \u2013 dein DJ-Setup lebt jetzt in deinem Raum.\n", "short_description": "M\u00fchelos auflegen in Mixed Reality. Mixe Tracks von SoundCloud oder aus unserer Bibliothek mit intuitiver Handtracking-Steuerung, die sich echt anf\u00fchlt. Sync, Cue, Scratchen und Sound-Gestaltung mit Profi-EQs \u2013 ganz ohne Equipment. Reaktionsschnelle Waveforms, nahtlose \u00dcberg\u00e4nge und Performen im eigenen Raum \u2013 mit der einfachsten MR-DJ-App \u00fcberhaupt."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2507904579734065", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Immersive DJ", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Crea mezclas perfectas \u2014 en tu habitaci\u00f3n, en la cocina o donde quieras.**\n\nEsta app de DJ en realidad mixta te da las herramientas de un equipo f\u00e1cil de usar con la sencillez y la diversi\u00f3n de la realidad mixta.\n\n# Qu\u00e9 incluye:\n\n* **Herramientas de mezcla fluidas**\n\n Usa **sync**, **cue** y crossfades suaves para crear transiciones sin esfuerzo.\n\n* **Scratch como el de verdad**\n\n Platos virtuales con gran respuesta te permiten hacer scratch para cuadrar pistas y tocar como si fuera un instrumento.\n\n* **Formas de onda que se leen de un vistazo**\n\nLas formas de onda generales y con desplazamiento, con **colores seg\u00fan la frecuencia**, te muestran cada drop, cada break y cada beat. Toca una forma de onda para saltar a esa parte del tema, \u00a1siempre a tempo!\n\n* **SoundCloud + biblioteca integrada**\n\nBusca y carga pistas r\u00e1pidamente desde **SoundCloud** o explora nuestra biblioteca seleccionada para empezar a mezclar al instante.\n\n* **Secci\u00f3n de EQ: \u00a1no hay nada como un barrido de filtro!**\n\nMoldea tu sonido con controles de DJ conocidos: **color**, **low**, **mid** y **high**.\n\n* **Seguimiento de manos natural**\n\nSin mandos. Maneja platos, controles giratorios y faders con tus manos para una experiencia que se siente realmente f\u00edsica.\n\nAct\u00faa por casting, practica o simplemente divi\u00e9rtete: tu equipo de DJ ahora vive en tu espacio.\n", "short_description": "Haz de DJ sin esfuerzo en realidad mixta. Mezcla pistas de SoundCloud o de nuestra biblioteca con un seguimiento de manos intuitivo que se siente real. Sincroniza, usa el cue, haz scratch y moldea tu sonido con ecualizadores profesionales, sin equipo. Sigue formas de onda reactivas, crea transiciones perfectas y act\u00faa en tu propio espacio con la app de DJ en realidad mixta m\u00e1s f\u00e1cil que existe."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2241281766454592", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Immersive DJ", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u90e8\u5c4b\u3067\u3082\u3001\u30ad\u30c3\u30c1\u30f3\u3067\u3082\u3001\u3069\u3053\u3067\u3082 \u2014 \u30b7\u30fc\u30e0\u30ec\u30b9\u306a\u30df\u30c3\u30af\u30b9\u3092\uff01**\n\n\u3053\u306eMR DJ\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea\u306f\u3001\u4f7f\u3044\u3084\u3059\u3044DJ\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u306e\u6a5f\u80fd\u3068\u3001MR\u306a\u3089\u3067\u306f\u306e\u624b\u8efd\u3055\u3068\u697d\u3057\u3055\u3092\u4e21\u7acb\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\n\n# \u4e3b\u306a\u6a5f\u80fd\uff1a\n\n* **\u30b7\u30fc\u30e0\u30ec\u30b9\u306a\u30df\u30c3\u30af\u30b9\u30c4\u30fc\u30eb**\n\n **\u30b7\u30f3\u30af**\u3001**\u30ad\u30e5\u30fc**\u3001\u30b9\u30e0\u30fc\u30ba\u306a\u30af\u30ed\u30b9\u30d5\u30a7\u30fc\u30c9\u3067\u3001\u7c21\u5358\u306b\u30c8\u30e9\u30f3\u30b8\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3092\u4f5c\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002\n\n* **\u672c\u7269\u3055\u306a\u304c\u3089\u306e\u30b9\u30af\u30e9\u30c3\u30c1**\n\n \u53cd\u5fdc\u306e\u826f\u3044\u30d0\u30fc\u30c1\u30e3\u30eb\u30c7\u30c3\u30ad\u3067\u3001\u30b9\u30af\u30e9\u30c3\u30c1\u3057\u306a\u304c\u3089\u66f2\u3092\u5408\u308f\u305b\u305f\u308a\u3001\u697d\u5668\u306e\u3088\u3046\u306b\u6f14\u594f\u3057\u305f\u308a\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\n\n* **\u3072\u3068\u76ee\u3067\u308f\u304b\u308b\u6ce2\u5f62\u8868\u793a**\n\n\u5168\u4f53\u6ce2\u5f62\u3068\u30b9\u30af\u30ed\u30fc\u30eb\u6ce2\u5f62\u306f**\u5468\u6ce2\u6570\u5225\u306e\u30ab\u30e9\u30fc\u8868\u793a**\u3067\u3001\u30c9\u30ed\u30c3\u30d7\u3001\u30d6\u30ec\u30a4\u30af\u30c0\u30a6\u30f3\u3001\u30d3\u30fc\u30c8\u304c\u4e00\u76ee\u77ad\u7136\u3002\u6ce2\u5f62\u3092\u30bf\u30c3\u30c1\u3059\u308c\u3070\u66f2\u306e\u305d\u306e\u4f4d\u7f6e\u3078\u30b8\u30e3\u30f3\u30d7 \u2014 \u3044\u3064\u3067\u3082\u30d3\u30fc\u30c8\u306b\u5408\u308f\u305b\u3066\uff01\n\n* **SoundCloud + \u5185\u8535\u30e9\u30a4\u30d6\u30e9\u30ea**\n\n**SoundCloud**\u304b\u3089\u66f2\u3092\u3059\u3070\u3084\u304f\u691c\u7d22\u30fb\u30ed\u30fc\u30c9\u3001\u307e\u305f\u306f\u53b3\u9078\u30e9\u30a4\u30d6\u30e9\u30ea\u304b\u3089\u3059\u3050\u306b\u30df\u30c3\u30af\u30b9\u3092\u59cb\u3081\u3089\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002\n\n* **EQ\u30bb\u30af\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3 \u2014 \u30d5\u30a3\u30eb\u30bf\u30fc\u30b9\u30a4\u30fc\u30d7\u306f\u6700\u9ad8\uff01**\n\n\u304a\u306a\u3058\u307f\u306eDJ\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30eb\u3067\u30b5\u30a6\u30f3\u30c9\u3092\u8abf\u6574\uff1a**\u30ab\u30e9\u30fc**\u3001**\u30ed\u30fc**\u3001**\u30df\u30c3\u30c9**\u3001**\u30cf\u30a4**\u3002\n\n* **\u81ea\u7136\u306a\u30cf\u30f3\u30c9\u30c8\u30e9\u30c3\u30ad\u30f3\u30b0**\n\n\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc\u4e0d\u8981\u3002\u30c7\u30c3\u30ad\u3001\u30ce\u30d6\u3001\u30b9\u30e9\u30a4\u30c0\u30fc\u3092\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u624b\u3067\u64cd\u4f5c\u3067\u304d\u3001\u672c\u7269\u306e\u3088\u3046\u306a\u624b\u5fdc\u3048\u3092\u4f53\u611f\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\n\n\u30ad\u30e3\u30b9\u30c8\u3057\u3066\u62ab\u9732\u3059\u308b\u3082\u3088\u3057\u3001\u7df4\u7fd2\u3059\u308b\u3082\u3088\u3057\u3001\u305f\u3060\u697d\u3057\u3080\u3082\u3088\u3057 \u2014 \u3042\u306a\u305f\u306eDJ\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u304c\u3001\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u7a7a\u9593\u306b\u3002\n", "short_description": "\u8907\u5408\u73fe\u5b9f\uff08MR\uff09\u3067\u624b\u8efd\u306bDJ\u3002SoundCloud\u3084\u5185\u8535\u30e9\u30a4\u30d6\u30e9\u30ea\u306e\u66f2\u3092\u3001\u30ea\u30a2\u30eb\u306a\u64cd\u4f5c\u611f\u306e\u30cf\u30f3\u30c9\u30c8\u30e9\u30c3\u30ad\u30f3\u30b0\u3067\u30df\u30c3\u30af\u30b9\u3002\u30b7\u30f3\u30af\u3001\u30ad\u30e5\u30fc\u3001\u30b9\u30af\u30e9\u30c3\u30c1\u3001\u30d7\u30ed\u4ed5\u